  "description": "Sub-workflow: sends one Lark message per input item as the Lark content bot, to the open_id in content_strategy.settings, or as a reply when reply_to is set. Input items: text or card (card JSON 2.0), reply_to, ref, purpose. Items without text or card are skipped. Logs each sent message in content_strategy.messages and returns message_id per sent item.",
